30年），屯田新安。建武十三年（37年），改封为向侯。永平二年（59年），去世。","link_td_id":"Q10002309","link_td_number_id":804201,"people_name":"王霸","people_name_jianti_auto":"王霸","people_xingming":"王霸","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94609e26-db0e-11ef-b6dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"贾览，中国新朝到东汉初期的武将。新末群雄之一，盧芳属下。","link_td_id":"Q10018152","link_td_number_id":5427052,"people_name":"賈覽","people_name_jianti_auto":"贾览","people_xingming":"贾览","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"94609e27-db0e-11ef-a3eb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高柳","place_name_jianti_auto":"高柳","resolved_place_entity_id":2362,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"94609e28-db0e-11ef-bcef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"94609e29-db0e-11ef-85a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平城","place_name_jianti_auto":"平城","resolved_place_entity_id":277,"start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"94609e2a-db0e-11ef-bc13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与匈奴的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0608"},{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、大同府（卷四十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"永平十六年，骑都尉来苖等讨北匈奴，分道出平城塞。晋建兴初...","context_before":"...攻楼烦三城，因击胡骑于平城下。寻属雁门郡，为东部都尉治。","source_end_index":120,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c76d2aed-af9d-5be7-950a-75be749d38e4","source_start_index":88,"source_text":"后汉建武十年，吴汉等出高柳，击破卢芳将贾览及匈奴数千骑于平城下。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/八、大同府（卷四十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1春，正月，吳漢復率捕虜將軍王霸等四將軍六萬人出高柳擊賈覽，匈奴數千騎救之，連戰於平城下，破走之。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，吴汉再次统领捕虏将军王霸等四位将军，总兵力六万人，由高柳县出兵进攻贾览，匈奴数千骑兵赶来救援贾览，双方在平城县城下接连交战，匈奴骑兵被击败后逃走。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，吴汉复率捕虏将军王霸等四将军六万人出高柳击贾览，匈奴数千骑救之，连战于平城下，破走之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3284,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94609e20-db0e-11ef-9b95-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRe