t":"2夏陽節侯馮異等與趙匡、田弇戰且一年，皆斬之。隗純未下，諸將欲且還休兵，異固持不動，共攻落門，未拔。夏，異薨於軍。","content_fanyi":"夏阳节侯冯异等人与赵匡、田弇交战将近一年，最后将二人全部斩杀。隗纯仍未被击败，其所在的城池也未攻下，这时东汉众将领想暂时退兵休整，冯异坚决不肯撤兵，与众人共同攻打落门聚，未能攻下。夏季，冯异在军中去世。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏阳节侯冯异等与赵匡、田弇战且一年，皆斩之。隗纯未下，诸将欲且还休兵，异固持不动，共攻落门，未拔。夏，异薨于军。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3285,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94609e2b-db0e-11ef-877c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"94609e4a-db0e-11ef-9f10-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3秋，八月，己亥，上幸長安。","content_fanyi":"秋季八月二十五日己亥，光武帝巡幸长安。","content_jianti_auto":"3秋，八月，己亥，上幸长安。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3286,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"94609e49-db0e-11ef-b791-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"馬援","people_name_jianti_auto":"马援","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94609e4d-db0e-11ef-9bf6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"峻","people_name_jianti_auto":"峻","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"94609e4e-db0e-11ef-93ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吳漢","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴汉","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94609e4f-db0e-11ef-a589-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"峻","people_name_jianti_auto":"峻","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"94609e50-db0e-11ef-b0e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"囂","