..","context_before":"...在今县东。汉县治此。后汉初，隗嚣据冀。汉将来歙等共攻嚣。","source_end_index":50,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d3f93678-5c83-500e-8cd6-0a999444d7a3","source_start_index":32,"source_text":"嚣卒，子纯复据冀。来歙破落门，纯降。"},{"context_after":"《郡国志》冀县有雒门聚，是也。三国汉延熙十三年，姜维攻狄...","context_before":"○落门聚[在县西十里，亦曰落门镇。","source_end_index":51,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"db0ac3a6-0215-52ba-ac1c-0a0caa33a8ed","source_start_index":17,"source_text":"后汉建武十年，隗嚣据冀。冯异攻其落门，未拔而卒。来歙复攻拔之，纯降。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/八、巩昌府（卷五十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"5冬，十月，來歙與諸將攻破落門，周宗、行巡、苟宇、趙恢等將隗純降，王元奔蜀。徙諸隗於京師以東。後隗純與賓客亡入胡，至武威，捕得，誅之。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月，来歙与众将领攻破落门聚，周宗、行巡、苟宇、赵恢等带着隗纯投降，王元投奔公孙述。光武帝将隗姓宗族迁徙到京师以东。后来隗纯与宾客逃入匈奴，到武威县时被捕获，处死。","content_jianti_auto":"5冬，十月，来歙与诸将攻破落门，周宗、行巡、苟宇、赵恢等将隗纯降，王元奔蜀。徙诸隗于京师以东。后隗纯与宾客亡入胡，至武威，捕得，诛之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3288,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94609e80-db0e-11ef-8704-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94609e96-db0e-11ef-ae7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94609e97-db0e-11ef-a4bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"94609e98-db0e-11ef-8210-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴右","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇右","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"94609e99-db0e-11ef-87d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"94609e9a-db0e-11ef-9f0b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"涼州諸郡至京師，皆須度隴。隴右安，則涼州之路流通。","note_content_jianti_auto":"凉州诸郡至京师，皆须度陇。陇右安，则凉州之路流通。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"94609e95-db0e-11ef-bae9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":35,"link_td_description":"来歙，字君叔，南阳郡新野（今河南省新野县）人，是光禄大夫来汉的六世孙，来仲與妻劉氏之子。东汉初期大臣。","link_td_id":"Q10007325","link_td_number_id":1556318,"people_name":"來歙","people_name_jianti_auto":"来歙","people_xingming":"来歙","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94609e9e-db0e-11ef-a000-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-50,"link_death_year":39,"link_td_description":"盖延，字巨卿，渔阳要阳人。东汉云台二十八将之一。","link_td_id":"Q10004334","link_td_number_id":931433,"people_name":"蓋延","people_name_jianti_auto":"盖延","people_xingming":"盖延","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"94609e9f-db0e-11ef-aae5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"先零羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"先零羌","resolved_place_entity_id":1028,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94609e9b-db0e-11ef-9b7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"金城","place_name_jianti_auto":"金城","resolved_place_entity_id":460,"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"94609e9c-db0e-11ef-8e0e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴西","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇西","resolved_place_entity_id":342,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"94609e9d-db0e-11ef-b7a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴右","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇右","resolved_place_entity_id":313,"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"94609ea0-db0e-11ef-a83f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","resolved_place_entity_id":156,"start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"94609ea1-db0e-11ef-b2ca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉平陇西之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0605"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、巩昌府（卷五十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《陇西记》：襄武有五溪，杨盛分羌为五部，错居溪旁。每溪为...","context_before":"五溪聚[在府东。《后汉志》注：襄武有五溪聚。","source_end_index":38,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"413aa9c0-4142-5306-9966-69f77b6b59e3","source_start_index":22,"source_text":"建武十年，来歙破羌于五溪，是也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/八、巩昌府（卷五十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","内政"],"content":"6先零羌與諸種寇金城、隴西，來歙率蓋延等進擊，大破之，斬首虜數千人。於是開倉廩以賑飢乏，隴右遂安，而涼州流通焉。","content_fanyi":"先零羌与其他部落一起侵犯金城、陇西二郡，来歙率领盖延等进击，大败来犯之敌，斩首和俘获数千人。于是打开粮仓赈济饥饿的百姓，陇山以西从此安定，凉州诸郡通往京师的道路也得以打通。","content_jianti_auto":"6先零羌与诸种寇金城、陇西，来歙率盖延等进击，大破之，斩首虏数千人。于是开仓廪以赈饥乏，陇右遂安，而凉州流通焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3289,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94609e92-db0e-11ef-9863-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"7庚寅，車駕還宮。","content_fanyi":"十月十七日庚寅，光武帝的车驾返回洛阳宫。","content_jianti_auto":"7庚寅，车驾还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3290,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94609ea2-db0e-11ef-9391-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"十年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"十年","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94609e1e-db0e-11ef-a934-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（甲午、三四）","year_int":34},"message":"success","success":true}